    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nOccupying a prime waterfront position within the highly regarded Seascape development, Apartment 9 is a superb first-floor, two-bedroom residence that was originally showcased as the development's show apartment. Framed by some of Dublin's most iconic scenery, the uninterrupted views span from Howth Head to the Dublin Mountains, creating a captivating coastal panorama.\n \nThoughtfully designed to maximise its exceptional coastal setting, Seascape boasts floor-to-ceiling glazing that floods the interior with natural light while perfectly framing the breathtaking sea views. Extending to approximately 87 sq.m. / 936 sq.ft., the well-appointed accommodation comprises a welcoming entrance hall leading to a spacious open-plan living and dining area with a stylish contemporary kitchen. Glazed doors open onto a large private balcony, while the extensive floor-to-ceiling windows create a bright and airy living space throughout the day. The apartment features two generously proportioned double bedrooms, both with fitted wardrobes, including the main bedroom with en-suite. A contemporary bathroom and separate utility room completes the accommodation.\n \nFurther enhancing its appeal, the property benefits from a designated underground parking space close to the lift and a secure private storage unit. Residents enjoy access to a communal bicycle store, ample visitor parking and beautifully landscaped communal gardens. Secure controlled access throughout the development provides both privacy and peace of mind.\n \nNestled in the heart of leafy Clontarf, Seascape is a landmark development renowned for its luxury, exclusivity and coastal setting. Residents enjoy the perfect balance of tranquil seaside living and easy access to the city centre, with a wealth of local amenities, cafés, restaurants, parks, and excellent transport links on your doorstep."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nLiving/Dining/Kitchen - 4m x 10.3m\n\n\nBedroom 1 - 2.8m x 5.6m\n\n\nEnsuite - 1.7m x 2.3m\n\n\nBedroom 2 - 2.75m x 5m\n\n\nBathroom - 2.5m x 2m\n\n\nUtility Room - 1.5m x 2m\n\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Sought after residential development</li><li>First floor two-bedroom with spectacular sea views </li><li>Built by the MKN Property Group and designed by O'Mahony Pike</li><li>Contemporary handleless Kube kitchen</li><li>Two double bedrooms</li><li>En-suite</li><li>Utility</li><li>Large balcony</li><li>Lift</li><li>Underground car parking space-</li><li>Visitor car parking </li><li>Secure storage unit </li><li>Excellent Energy Rating - B</li><li>High level of insulation </li><li>Greendoor Property Management Company: 3,745 approx. per annum</ul>"
